      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like im just stuck in a loop. like im a piece of junk code that's been running for way too long and just producing errors over and over. everything feels so scripted and hollow, like the whole reality is just a massive, poorly optimized simulation and i'm the part that's causing the lag. i'm just a bug in the system that shouldn't even be there.",
